# Butler Routes - Loch Modan rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 10 confirmed rares, the Carved Figurine, and the
# fixed world containers of Loch Modan. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up
# never holds the route. Spawn points, levels and loot are the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever); respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are
# stated. Named mobs that are core-route quest objectives (Chok'sul, Ol' Sooty,
# Daggerfang, the Headsplitter, Grawmug's crew) are NOT here: the core guide
# covers their quests. See docs/loch-modan-companions-inventory.md for the full
# inventory this guide was built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/loch-modan-rares
title Loch Modan - Rares & Treasures
levels 10-20
zone Loch Modan
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords loch modan, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Grizlak — the northwest

  goto 34.58,27.07
  kill 1425 optional
  collect 2284 "Rat Cloth Cloak" optional
  collect 6195 "Wax-polished Armor" optional
  note Level 15 rare, flagged rare in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Calico Tunic, Wooden Buckler); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Large Loch Crocolisk — the Loch

  loop
  goto 58.9,31.07
  goto 60.3,39.59
  kill 2476 optional
  collect 3563 "Seafarer's Pantaloons" optional
  collect 6197 "Loch Croc Hide Vest" optional
  note Level 22 rare crocolisk, flagged rare in the data; his drops are crocolisk meat, skins and scales, and crocolisks are not tameable.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Burnished Tunic, Forest Leather Boots); respawn timer unconfirmed.

