step Shanda the Spinner — the east

  goto 78.09,52.35
  kill 14266 optional
  task "Tame it instead of killing it" optional only Hunter
  collect 282636 "Silkspun Gloves" optional
  note Level 19 rare spider, flagged rare in the data; her drops are spider meat, venom sacs, venom and ichor.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Burnished Tunic, Forest Leather Boots); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Emogg the Crusher — the northeast

  goto 73.09,26.96
  kill 14267 optional
  collect 282639 "Emogg's \"Crusher\"" optional
  note Level 19 rare, flagged rare in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Laced Mail Vest, Laced Cloak); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Boss Galgosh — the southeast

  goto 68.07,65.93
  kill 1398 optional
  collect 1215 "Support Girdle" optional
  collect 1938 "Block Mallet" optional
  note Level 22 rare, flagged rare in the data. Holds the Stonesplinter hold with Magosh.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Laced Mail Vest, Laced Cloak); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Magosh — the southeast

  goto 70.12,66.39
  kill 1399 optional
  collect 2241 "Desperado Cape" optional
  collect 3571 "Trogg Beater" optional
  note Level 21 rare, flagged rare in the data. Holds the Stonesplinter hold with Boss Galgosh.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Laced Mail Vest, Laced Cloak); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Lord Condar — the southeast hills

  loop
  goto 62.57,78.54
  goto 74.62,70.77
  goto 74.74,66.89
  goto 77.74,74.93
  kill 14268 optional
  collect 282637 "Shaking Egg" optional
  note Level 16 rare, flagged rare in the data. His drops include a buzzard beak and a shaking egg, which suggest a bird — but a harpy fits them just as well, and harpies are not tameable, so there is no tame line; correct the guide if the game contradicts it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Hunting Tunic, Veteran Armor); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Haren Swifthoof — south-central Loch Modan

  goto 55.45,67.06
  kill 2478 optional
  collect 5319 "Bashing Pauldrons" optional
  note Level 20 rare. Dens with Thragomm nearby; the two are separate kills.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Laced Mail Vest, Laced Cloak); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Thragomm — south-central Loch Modan

  goto 55.3,66.94
  kill 7170 optional
  collect 4949 "Orcish Cleaver" optional
  note Level 20 rare. Dens with Haren Swifthoof nearby; the two are separate kills.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Laced Mail Vest, Laced Cloak); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Carved Figurine — the dam's north bank

  goto 49.42,12.92
  interact 424007 optional
  note The figurine starts Eagle's Fist (79975), a level-32 chain per the data — far above this guide's band and out of the core contract, so bank it for later. Wet Job (79974), also level 32 and uncontracted, ends at this same point. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

